  "A priced warrant, reset warrant, floor-price warrant, or variable-price warrant is row_role conditional unless the same instrument has a source-backed zero-exercise, zero price exercise, nominal-exercise, pre-funded, or economically equivalent exercise path.",
  "Low Price, Floor Price, reset, VWAP, or discount mechanics by themselves do not make an instrument row_role counted.",
  "Alternative securities inside the same maximum pool must not be added together. Use one row for the maximum share/ADS-equivalent pool when possible, with a label/value/note that names the alternatives.",
