  "If the numerator is Class A, ADSs, or another specific security basis, share_overhang.basis must use the same specific security basis. Do not add Class B, preferred, voting-power, total ordinary-share, or other-class counts to a Class A or ADS denominator.",
  "Build share_overhang before snapshot_metrics. Snapshot metrics are result summary cards, not the source of the share-overhang calculation.",
  "The Dilution Snapshot UI uses display_payload.data.snapshot_metrics exactly. For offering_terms, provide 4 snapshot_metrics rows when source-backed facts allow it.",
